{"version":1,"id":"auli-i-cravalho-how-far-i-ll-go","title":"How Far I'll Go","artist":"Auli'i Cravalho","key":"C","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/aulii-cravalho/how-far-ill-go/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Mark Mancina and Lin-Manuel Miranda","chords":[{"symbol":"E","canonical":"E","keyboardPitchClasses":[4,8,11],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"F#m","canonical":"F#m","keyboardPitchClasses":[6,9,1],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"C#m","canonical":"C#m","keyboardPitchClasses":[1,4,8],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"A","canonical":"A","keyboardPitchClasses":[9,1,4],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"B","canonical":"B","keyboardPitchClasses":[11,3,6],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Am","canonical":"Am","keyboardPitchClasses":[9,0,4],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"F#","canonical":"F#","keyboardPitchClasses":[6,10,1],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"C#","canonical":"C#","keyboardPitchClasses":[1,5,8],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"D#m","canonical":"D#m","keyboardPitchClasses":[3,6,10],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Bm","canonical":"Bm","keyboardPitchClasses":[11,2,6],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"lyric","text":"I've been staring at the edge of the water","columns":42,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#m","column":38,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":"Long as I can remember, never really knowing why","columns":48,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":17,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":42,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"I wish I could be the perfect daughter","columns":38,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#m","column":31,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"But I come back to the water, no matter how hard I try","columns":54,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":24,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":52,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"Every turn I take, every trail I track","columns":38,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":6,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"Every path I make, every road leads back","columns":40,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":6,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"To the place I know, where I can not go","columns":39,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":7,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"Where I long to be","columns":18,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":9,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":"See the line where the sky meets the sea? It calls me","columns":53,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B","column":47,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"And no one knows, how far it goes","columns":33,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":12,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":31,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"If the wind in my sail on the sea stays behind me","columns":49,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":7,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B","column":44,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"One day I'll know, if I go there's just no telling how far I'll go","columns":66,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":14,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Am","column":26,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"I know, everybody on this island seems so happy on this island","columns":62,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#m","column":26,"beat":2},{"symbol":"C#m","column":57,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"Everything is by design","columns":23,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":16,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"I know, everybody on this island has a role on this island","columns":58,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F#m","column":26,"beat":2},{"symbol":"C#m","column":53,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"So maybe I can roll with mine","columns":29,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A","column":22,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"I can lead with pride, I can make us strong","columns":43,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":6,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"lyric","text":"I'll be satisfied if I play along","columns":33,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"B","column":8,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"lyric","text":"But the voice inside sings a different song","columns":43,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":8,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"What is wrong with me?","columns":22,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":8,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-21","kind":"lyric","text":"See the light as it shines on the sea? It's blinding","columns":52,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B","column":47,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-22","kind":"lyric","text":"But no one knows, how deep it goes","columns":34,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":12,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":32,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-23","kind":"lyric","text":"And it seems like it's calling out to me, so come find me","columns":57,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"E","column":7,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B","column":53,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-24","kind":"lyric","text":"And let me know, what's beyond that line, will I cross that line?","columns":65,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C#m","column":12,"beat":0},{"symbol":"A","column":28,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-25","kind":"lyric","text":"See the line where the sky meets the sea? It calls me","columns":53,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#","column":8,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#","column":48,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-26","kind":"lyric","text":"And no one knows, how far it goes","columns":33,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#m","column":11,"beat":0},{"symbol":"B","column":30,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-27","kind":"lyric","text":"If the wind in my sail on the sea stays behind me","columns":49,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F#","column":7,"beat":0},{"symbol":"C#","column":45,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-28","kind":"lyric","text":"One day I'll know, how far I'll go","columns":40,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"D#m","column":13,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Bm","column":33,"beat":2},{"symbol":"F#","column":38,"beat":4}]}]}